SUMMARY:Scenic Avl Series #1: Hard Times Trail - Arboretum
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nJoin me for a hike after work in B
 ent Creek. We will start at the Hard Times trailhead and hike about 5.5 mi
 les\, going into the Arboretum to see the flowers.\n\nWeather forecast cur
 rently shows light rain. If the weather forecast changes to thunderstorms\
 , hike will cancel by 4 PM.\n\nRating: Moderate\nLength: 5.5 miles\nSurfac
 e: Trail/Logging Road\nElevation Gain: 600 ft\nPace: 3 mph on the flats\, 
 slower on incline\nDogs: on leash\nBears: None so far this year\nFeatures:
  Nice walk through the woods. We will not go to the Arboretum because it i
 s closed.\nCautions: Muddy after rain\, with some high grass. Long pants a
 nd bug repellent recommended.\nHeadlamp in winter ❄️\n\nCarpool: 5:35 
 from Papa's and Beer on Brevard Road\n\nSpring/Summer/Fall Route: [https:/
 /www.alltrails.com/explore/custom-routes/copy-scenic-avl-1-hardtimes-arbor
 etum-lollipop-loop-99bac84?u=i&sh=ifwm3x ](https://www.alltrails.com/explo
 re/custom-routes/copy-scenic-avl-1-hardtimes-arboretum-lollipop-loop-99bac
 84?u=i&sh=ifwm3x)\n\nWinter Route: [https://www.alltrails.com/explore/map/
 hard-times-alternate-37968ad](https://www.alltrails.com/explore/map/hard-t
 imes-alternate-37968ad)\n\nScenic Asheville Series: There are 9 hikes in t
 he series\; hike them all and receive an attractive badge for your backpac
 k.\n\nRSVP and On-Time Start:\n\n\\*If you decide you cannot come\, please
  change your RSVP\n\n* If you must cancel\, please change your status to "
 Not Going" as soon as possible so wait-listers can have sufficient notice.
 \n\\*There are generally 1 or 2 no-shows on my hikes\, so we don't wait fo
 r people to arrive. If you are late\, you'll be left behind.\n* If you no-
 show 2 times without changing your RSVP and/or contacting the hike leader\
 , you may be blocked from the group.\n\\*Please note that there is never c
 ell coverage at the start of the hike\, so please change your RSVP as soon
  as you know you can't make it.\n\nNotes and comments are genuinely apprec
 iated.\n\nNo Guests: Please ask guests to sign up for the hike themselves.
 \n\nDisclaimer and Release of Liability:\nThis activity involves hiking on
  city streets that may have traffic. Participants are responsible for thei
 r safety on streets and trails. The organizer of this trip is a volunteer 
 and not a professional guide. The function of the organizer is only to org
 anize this trip. If you sign up or participate in this event you acknowled
 ge that you freely and voluntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\,
  illnesses\, and damages arising from\, as a result of\, and associated wi
 th this event. In addition\, you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup 
 terms: [https://www.meetup.com/terms](https://www.meetup.com/terms)\n\nHar
 d Times Trailhead\n375 Wesley Branch Rd · Asheville\, NC\n\nThere is no c
 ellular coverage at the trailhead! If you're late\, there will be no way t
 o contact us. Look for a white Subaru Crosstrek with a Peking University b
 umper sticker at the trailhead.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/315135444
 /
