SUMMARY:Bent Creek--Rice Pinnacle--Stradley Mountain Loop  9.7 miles\, 130
 0 ft ascent
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**Trailhead: Rice Pinnacle\, Bent 
 Creek**\n**Description**: Good footing\, mostly shaded\, gradual ascent. T
 ake the Deer Lake Lodge trail to Wolf Branch Trail to Ledford Trail (R) to
  Road 479 (R) to left on Rice Pinnacle Rd (491) and start of climb. At Ing
 les Field Gap take a sharp left on trail of the same name and ascend to Fo
 ur corners--Stradley Mt. Take Little Hickory Top and descend to Ledford Ga
 p and snack at picnic tables. Take Boyd Branch to Campground Connector\, B
 ent Creek Gap Rd to Wesley Branch Trailhead. Deer Lake Lodge Trail back to
  Rice Pinnacle. Type: Loop. Max Elev: 3000'. Avg moving pace: 2.3 mph. Dog
 s on leash OK\n**Lunch is an option following the hike!**\n\n\\*\\*COURTES
 Y (Please read carefully!)\\*\\* Only sign up if you \\\\\\*truly\\\\\\* p
 lan to come. If you must cancel\, please change your status to "Not Going"
  as soon as possible. Avoid dropping out last-minute so that wait-listers 
 can have sufficient notice. And please please PLEASE don't be a no-show\n\
 n**LEGALESE**\nThis Asheville Hiking Group event involves hiking and\, pos
 sibly\, transportation to and from the meetup site. Participants are respo
 nsible for their own safety and affirm that they have the appropriate skil
 ls\, physical conditioning\, equipment\, and supplies. Hiking may involve 
 risks to oneself and property. Neither your hike organizer nor Asheville H
 iking Group can assure your safety nor eliminate all risks. Participants a
 ssume full responsibility for any injuries\, damages\, or losses.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/315106164
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260604T175536Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260604T175536Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
