X-SOURCE:Asheville Hiking Group
UID:event_315135758@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260609T040706Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260612T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260612T123000
SUMMARY:Arboretum Hard Times Loop - 6.5 Miles\, 700 Ft Elevation Gain
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**RSVP opens Sunday\, Jun 7th\, 8:
 00 pm**\n\nI will be leading Barry's hikes for the next 4 weeks and will d
 o my best to select some hikes similar to what he normally does. This hike
  will start inside the Arboretum but don't worry if you don't have a membe
 rship. We will have enough cars that do. We will start by the Education Ce
 nter and head down Bent Creek Rd and over to the Hard Times Rd by Lake Pow
 hattan. We will go up Hard Times and eventually back into the Arboretum by
  the guard house and then back up Wesley Branch to the main parking lot. T
 otal distance is around 6.5 miles with an elevation gain of just under 700
  ft. The trails are mostly wide and good for visiting. We'll do a moderate
  pace of around 2.4 mph. It's not an easy hike for many of us. I'd give it
  a 4 out of 10\, while many of my other hikes are in the 2 - 3.5 range wit
 h half the elevation gain.\n\nThere is no need to carpool as there is plen
 ty of parking but if you don't have an Arboretum pass\, we will meet at th
 e Asheville Outlet parking lot behind the Waffle House. I listed that as t
 he hike location. We will leave the parking lot right at 9:15 so please be
  a bit early.\n\nWear sensible hiking footwear\, and bring an ample water 
 supply. Around 2/3 of the way through\, we'll find a spot for a short snac
 k break.\n\nThe Arboretum has a nice Bistro if anyone wants to stay for lu
 nch after the hike.\n\n***Dog Policy:*** Dogs are extremely welcome but mu
 st be leashed.\n\n***Guest Policy:*** If you'd like to bring a guest\, the
 y should join the Asheville Hiking Group and sign up for the hike on their
  own. Alternatively\, contact me in advance and ask if it's okay to bring 
 a "+1" after you've made it onto the "Going" list. Depending on timing and
  demand\, I MAY be able to add your guest.\n\n**MEET-UP TIME AND PLACE**\n
 Please either meet at the Arboretum Education Center at 9:30 or the Ashevi
 lle Outlet Mall parking lot behind the Waffle House at 9:15.\n\n**COURTESY
  TO WAIT-LISTERS (Please abide!)**\nOnly sign up if you \\*TRULY\\* plan t
 o come. If you must cancel\, please change your status to "Not Going" as s
 oon as possible so wait-listers will have sufficient notice. And please pl
 ease PLEASE don't be a no-show.\nIf you're on the waiting list\, keep chec
 king the evening before. Despite what I wrote above\, we always get last-m
 inute dropouts.\n\n**WEATHER**\nI'll monitor National Weather Service fore
 casts for the hike area and email cancellation messages by 7:30 AM if the 
 forecast is for more than a 50% chance of precipitation.\n\n**QUESTIONS?**
 \nIf you have any questions\, message me through MeetUp until 8:00 AM the 
 day of. Cell reception may be sketchy on the trail\, but you can try to te
 xt or call me up to the start of the hike: 508-965-2333.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/315135758
 /
